#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-xplane.rst:10
#: f678c3e166e14172a823d14ff7730316
msgid "Soaring SITL with X-Plane"
msgstr "使用 X-Plane 进行滑翔 SITL 仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/soaring-sitl-with-xplane.rst:12
#: 95b58a426d0c45638b13dcb1cf5506ed
msgid ""
"As of March 2017, ArduPlane has a :ref:`soaring capability <soaring>` that "
"allows many fixed-wing aircraft to stay in the air without motor power by "
"exploiting rising air currents called *thermals*. These instructions are "
"intended for people who would like to try out ArduPlane's soaring controller"
" in a :ref:`software-in-the-loop (SITL) simulation <sitl-simulator-software-"
"in-the-loop>` with X-Plane, a popular commercial flight simulator."
msgstr ""
"自 2017 年 3 月起，ArduPlane 新增了 :ref:`滑翔功能 "
"<soaring>`，允许许多固定翼飞机在无需电机动力的情况下，通过利用名为「热流」的上升气流保持飞行。本说明面向希望通过 "
"X-Plane（一款流行的商业飞行仿真器）在 :ref:`软件在环（SITL）仿真 <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>` 中体验 ArduPlane 滑翔控制器的用户。"

